    "Branch 2, anywhere else: the location must say worldwide, anywhere, global, Europe/EU/EMEA or just Remote, and must not name a country or a German place. A remote job pinned to Germany needs branch 1.",
    "Source of the profile: ~/.claude/skills/tailor/references/profile.md (M.Eng. Applied AI student at TH Deggendorf, German student permit: Werkstudent and mandatory internships)."
